# Start the API: from repo root run `npm run dev`, or `cd backend && npm run start:dev`, or `cd frontend && npm run dev:stack`.
#
# Dev: leave empty (or commented) to use Vite proxy `/bb-api` -> http://localhost:3000
# (avoids CORS / Network Error when frontend origin or port changes).
#
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
#
# Production: HTTPS backend URL (without trailing slash). Backend must allow frontend origin in CORS_ORIGIN.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
